{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんはです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ何日かはすごく暑くて夏みたいですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん、体調などは崩してないですか?\n大丈夫ですか🙂"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ暑い日が続くみたいなのでお気をつけ下さいね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう言えば。\nお皿を少しばかり新調できまして余計お料理楽しくなりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、大体作るのがお昼ご飯が多いのです時間帯的になのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜だともうちょっと品数増やしたさあります🍽"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて。いつかのまた載せます!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP1PXTF928F25DD1M7P606","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パパッとお昼ご飯なので ちょっと少ないですが…🙇‍♀️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*エリンギと彩り野菜のグリル*豚バラ茄子のうま塩ダレ*長ねぎとお豆腐のお味噌汁"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP1QZ81RXKMTN9WK4QNEJS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n豚バラなすのは、作りおき食堂まりえさん のレシピを参考にさせて頂きました!\nレンチンで、調理時間わずか10分"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄すぎです!  \n移動時間よく まりえさんのレシピ見てます笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP1S1PXMSHVG9TVHF9N85Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グリル野菜は、エリンギ、ピーマン、じゃがいもと、この前上げた ベーコンアスパラを作った際に残ったパプリカとアスパラを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"brea